1
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:29,360
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:32,940
[Episode 15]

3
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,120
I never expected that

4
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:13,890
you were the one who
destroyed everything for my sister and me.

5
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:17,410
Thousands of years later,

6
00:01:18,170 --> 00:01:21,030
you even want to destroy
the very last memory of her.

7
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:23,830
You truly deserve to die.

8
00:01:24,570 --> 00:01:25,990
What are you talking about?

9
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:27,400
Have you forgotten

10
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:30,160
the sins you committed yourself?

11
00:01:35,430 --> 00:01:36,840
Sister! Sister!

12
00:01:37,210 --> 00:01:39,000
I grew a new bud today!

13
00:01:39,729 --> 00:01:41,890
When do you think I'll grow up

14
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:44,479
and become a Tree Spirit
as beautiful as you?

15
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,789
If you work hard at magic,

16
00:01:46,820 --> 00:01:48,350
you'll grow up much faster.

17
00:01:50,310 --> 00:01:51,479
Sister,

18
00:01:51,479 --> 00:01:53,479
have you finished weaving that yet?

19
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:56,000
I told you to study, but you never did.

20
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,920
But you know how to weave it,

21
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,039
so I don't need to learn.

22
00:01:59,039 --> 00:02:00,300
Look. Isn't it pretty?

23
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,120
Let me put it on you.

24
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:02,710
Okay.

25
00:02:02,790 --> 00:02:03,390
Come here.

26
00:02:05,890 --> 00:02:06,930
So cute.

27
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,169
The Tree Spirit is inside. Hurry!

28
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,870
Sister.

29
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,160
We are playing hide-and-seek now.

30
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,110
Hide quickly.

31
00:02:28,210 --> 00:02:29,270
Don't make a sound.

32
00:02:51,790 --> 00:02:53,120
The Tree Spirit is here!

33
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:22,100
Sister.

34
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:31,870
Move.

35
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,450
Move.

36
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,630
I saw it.

37
00:04:24,730 --> 00:04:25,820
But I don't remember.

38
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:26,950
You don't remember?

39
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,520
Of course you don't.

40
00:04:29,090 --> 00:04:31,460
You were the one
who took my sister to the palace,

41
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:32,560
draining her blood day after day

42
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,960
to feed that old Emperor!

43
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:36,920
And now,

44
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,870
you still dare to show up.

45
00:04:39,530 --> 00:04:41,860
You even dare to ruin their relationship!

46
00:04:42,310 --> 00:04:44,560
I'll grind your bones to ash!

47
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,600
No!

48
00:04:48,990 --> 00:04:49,840
Xie He.

49
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:51,870
Don't kill him.

50
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,880
Song Yiqiu.

51
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,390
You're saving him again?

52
00:05:01,150 --> 00:05:02,750
Have you forgotten who he is?

53
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,740
He is the one you should hate the most!

54
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,800
He's Lin Huai.

55
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,070
Lin Huai has never harmed me.

56
00:05:10,190 --> 00:05:12,320
What on earth is wrong with you, Xie He?

57
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,430
Fine.

58
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:16,200
I'll make you see clearly for yourself

59
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:19,560
just how ridiculous and pathetic you are!

60
00:05:29,050 --> 00:05:30,010
No.

61
00:05:36,230 --> 00:05:37,080
Lin Huai.

62
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:39,750
Lin Huai.

63
00:05:44,290 --> 00:05:44,930
I...

64
00:05:46,110 --> 00:05:48,110
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

65
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:50,830
I...

66
00:05:51,810 --> 00:05:53,810
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

67
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:56,510
I...

68
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,610
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

69
00:06:13,610 --> 00:06:15,830
That was my first time
entering the palace to meet His Majesty.

70
00:06:15,830 --> 00:06:18,200
Before I left, my mother
repeatedly reminded me

71
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,440
to keep my eyes down.

72
00:06:20,170 --> 00:06:21,720
But I was always

73
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,360
so curious about the palace.

74
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,170
I couldn't help but look up.

75
00:06:26,750 --> 00:06:27,630
And then...

76
00:06:28,190 --> 00:06:29,480
I saw her.

77
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:35,230
A bird trapped in a golden cage.

78
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:39,040
It looked like she might
jump from that height at any moment.

79
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,159
Not to fall,

80
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:42,040
but to fly.

81
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:45,590
But the walls in this palace are so high.

82
00:06:45,590 --> 00:06:48,120
Those who wish to fly will die.

83
00:06:49,270 --> 00:06:49,930
Will she...

84
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:51,680
die?

85
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,100
Since you are still alive,

86
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:51,940
let me help you fly.

87
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:01,600
His Majesty has just taken his medicine.

88
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:04,430
General, please rest
in the Imperial Garden for a while.

89
00:08:04,430 --> 00:08:05,890
When His Majesty wakes up,

90
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,600
you will be summoned to see him.

91
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,560
Alright.

92
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:19,310
This huge palace

93
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:22,830
is filled with nothing but dull people.

94
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:55,020
♪ Swallow goes south to the setting sun ♪

95
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:57,510
♪ Smiling at late autumn's sudden warmth ♪

96
00:08:58,330 --> 00:09:01,940
♪ Through all the twists and turns,
my heart still holds on ♪

97
00:09:01,970 --> 00:09:04,570
♪ Leaving only gentleness behind ♪

98
00:09:05,370 --> 00:09:11,860
♪ Through a thousand years of cold,
my dreams are warmed by you ♪

99
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:17,560
♪ Two inches of fleeting youth,
memories I can never stop reliving ♪

100
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,510
Greetings, Your Majesty.

101
00:09:13,510 --> 00:09:15,480
My dear general,
you found the Tree Spirit for me,

102
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,750
and made a great contribution.

103
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,150
Among all the officials,

104
00:09:18,670 --> 00:09:20,030
only you

105
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,900
♪ Frost touches my brows ♪

106
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,080
know my worries.

107
00:09:21,930 --> 00:09:24,960
♪ I still wish for rain,
even if I must hold the umbrella alone ♪

108
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,320
Your Majesty is blessed
with heavenly fortune.

109
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,600
You are surely destined for a long life.

110
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,440
Well said.

111
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:32,320
♪ A thousand robes of fine silk,
I never care to look closely ♪

112
00:09:27,550 --> 00:09:28,880
Whatever else you want,

113
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,510
I will grant it to you.

114
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,390
I...

115
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,200
do have a request.

116
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:36,580
♪ The simple pleasures
of this world feel like an illusion ♪

117
00:09:35,390 --> 00:09:35,870
I

118
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:39,230
♪ If you're not here ♪

119
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:39,270
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

120
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:45,330
♪ Don't blame me
for having no worldly desires ♪

121
00:09:42,630 --> 00:09:43,630
Who is that?

122
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:46,790
You Majesty, it's the princess

123
00:09:46,790 --> 00:09:48,790
you brought back from among
the common folk years ago.

124
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:50,720
She is now living in Duansi Palace.

125
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:54,810
I admire the princess deeply.

126
00:09:55,650 --> 00:09:58,110
I humbly ask Your Majesty
for your blessing.

127
00:09:59,150 --> 00:09:59,790
Very well.

128
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:03,480
♪ Looking back from the shore
of the river of time ♪

129
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,520
You have my blessing.

130
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,750
Thank you for your gracious blessing,
Your Majesty.

131
00:10:03,510 --> 00:10:06,980
♪ The falling flowers are brighter
than the fireworks ♪

132
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:06,870
Princess Ningjia
is gentle and intelligent.

133
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:09,510
General Yu is second to none
in loyalty and bravery.

134
00:10:07,010 --> 00:10:09,970
♪ A life, a promise,
walking slowly along the shore ♪

135
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:10,870
You two are a perfect match.

136
00:10:09,990 --> 00:10:13,850
♪ As if yesterday passed without regrets ♪

137
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,480
I hereby grant them permission to marry,

138
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:15,000
and they'll be wed on the auspicious
eighth day of the third lunar month

139
00:10:13,870 --> 00:10:17,360
♪ I can smile upon the reunions
and partings of the past ♪

140
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,600
as a token of my special favor.

141
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,200
General.

142
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:20,750
♪ Yet forgetting you is far too hard ♪

143
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,480
What is this?

144
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,240
This is the bow I used when I was 15,

145
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:22,300
when I first went to the battlefield.

146
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,840
I still remember how hard it was

147
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,870
just to draw it.

148
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,080
Then what is this red silk for?

149
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,960
A betrothal gift.

150
00:10:34,010 --> 00:10:34,870
A betrothal gift?

151
00:10:34,870 --> 00:10:35,680
General,

152
00:10:35,790 --> 00:10:37,510
you are marrying a princess.

153
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:38,790
She spends all her days inside the palace,

154
00:10:38,790 --> 00:10:40,510
and never even leaves her room.

155
00:10:40,510 --> 00:10:41,790
How could she understand any of this?

156
00:10:41,790 --> 00:10:42,870
Yes, General.

157
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:44,730
Can that princess even draw a bow?

158
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,720
She can.

159
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:53,550
Fire!

160
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,630
The Princess has fled with her guard.

161
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:57,740
The Emperor has ordered her captured.

162
00:10:57,740 --> 00:10:59,020
Dead or alive!

163
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,200
Understood!

164
00:11:00,670 --> 00:11:01,270
Hyah!

165
00:11:05,150 --> 00:11:05,960
Hyah!

166
00:11:13,390 --> 00:11:14,600
Hyah!

167
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:23,270
I followed the trail of your escape.

168
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:26,150
I didn't know what I wanted.

169
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:29,170
I only knew that at that moment,

170
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,550
I wanted to see you.

171
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:39,600
No.

172
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:52,920
That was the first time you saw me.

173
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,530
But I never dared let you know

174
00:11:57,010 --> 00:11:58,090
who I was.

175
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:07,450
♪ Love is stained
with a touch of quiet sorrow ♪

176
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:09,870
♪ Under a crescent moon ♪

177
00:12:10,570 --> 00:12:15,690
♪ Brewing a glass of bitter cold wine ♪

178
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:13,910
Why?

179
00:12:16,830 --> 00:12:22,630
♪ Sighing over late autumn's
endless sorrows ♪

180
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:21,600
Why? Why?

181
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:27,880
♪ I long for the wild geese flying south ♪

182
00:12:28,730 --> 00:12:34,390
♪ Who'll bring a letter from the clouds ♪

183
00:12:34,410 --> 00:12:36,230
♪ People scatter and part ♪

184
00:12:36,580 --> 00:12:41,060
♪ A tender dream left stranded ♪

185
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:40,240
You are General Yu.

186
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,720
It all started

187
00:12:41,300 --> 00:12:44,060
♪ Heartbroken in loneliness ♪

188
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:43,830
because of him.

189
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,810
♪ So little joy remains ♪

190
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:46,910
If it weren't for his ridiculous proposal,

191
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:47,960
you and Ning Changyue
would never have suffered

192
00:12:46,990 --> 00:12:53,060
♪ Even speaking of it is too painful ♪

193
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,120
for these 3,000 painful years.

194
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,920
He's the one who ruined you both!

195
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,440
No.

196
00:12:53,590 --> 00:12:56,190
♪ Speaking of hope ♪

197
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:59,060
♪ The song ends as mist and smoke clear ♪

198
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:57,840
I love her.

199
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:05,350
♪ Laughter can never
ease the pain of parting ♪

200
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:01,440
I do love her.

201
00:13:05,900 --> 00:13:11,710
♪ A misty rain, forever unpaid ♪

202
00:13:08,630 --> 00:13:09,910
Why?

203
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,320
The Emperor has ordered

204
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,670
her killed on sight.

205
00:13:12,070 --> 00:13:18,510
♪ Who pities me,
with only my shadow for company? ♪

206
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:25,120
Kill her on sight?

207
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,720
What a ruthless order.

208
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,320
This is treason!

209
00:13:37,340 --> 00:13:39,490
General Yu has rebelled!

210
00:13:50,910 --> 00:13:53,310
Protect the Emperor! Protect the Emperor!

211
00:14:12,390 --> 00:14:14,480
Kill! Kill! Kill him!

212
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,960
Kill him for me!

213
00:14:48,630 --> 00:14:49,480
General Yu,

214
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:50,550
I...

215
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,400
will make you a king,

216
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,840
and share this world with you.

217
00:14:56,250 --> 00:14:56,720
No, no.

218
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:57,840
I'll give it all to you.

219
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,300
I'll give you everything.

220
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:00,780
Spare me!

221
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:03,630
Please spare me!

222
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:22,770
I should atone for my sins.

223
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:26,710
So I killed the Emperor.

224
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:33,120
I heard many people cheering,

225
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:37,200
because he was never a good ruler.

226
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:41,240
I also heard many people crying,

227
00:15:42,940 --> 00:15:44,640
because a palace coup often means...

228
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:46,240
countless deaths.

229
00:15:47,790 --> 00:15:49,920
Fortunately, you were not among them.

230
00:15:52,750 --> 00:15:54,120
Oh, Heavens.

231
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:59,180
If there is a next life,
let me see her just one more time.

232
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,440
By then,

233
00:16:02,220 --> 00:16:04,930
we will no longer be
a general and a princess.

234
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:08,630
I only wish I could simply be myself,

235
00:16:09,430 --> 00:16:11,270
and she could simply be herself.

236
00:16:12,490 --> 00:16:14,550
May we meet again as ordinary people,

237
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:17,240
and let me give her

238
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:20,180
happiness without any constraints.

239
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:23,150
Even if it's just for a moment,

240
00:16:24,060 --> 00:16:25,660
it would be more than enough.

241
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:43,910
♪ A flickering tenderness ♪

242
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:47,050
♪ Follows where your gaze rests ♪

243
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:50,550
♪ In this vast universe ♪

244
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:53,060
♪ Guarding quietly from afar ♪

245
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:57,550
♪ Love is hidden in the night sky ♪

246
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:01,060
♪ Behind every star ♪

247
00:17:01,590 --> 00:17:03,560
♪ A dream so insignificant ♪

248
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:06,410
♪ Yet so fiercely firm ♪

249
00:17:08,980 --> 00:17:12,380
♪ That beam of light pierced
through time and space ♪

250
00:17:12,420 --> 00:17:15,760
♪ Longing rushes in
across the light-years ♪

251
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:21,660
♪ For you, I do not fear
losing control while falling ♪

252
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:24,760
♪ Before the night departs ♪

253
00:17:25,599 --> 00:17:28,250
♪ Even if I burn out ♪

254
00:17:28,990 --> 00:17:31,010
♪ I'll let the fragments behind me ♪

255
00:17:31,030 --> 00:17:35,810
♪ Fulfill all your wishes ♪

256
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:39,080
♪ Leaving a ray of light ♪

257
00:17:39,460 --> 00:17:42,660
♪ Dreaming of brushing past you again ♪

258
00:17:42,770 --> 00:17:44,770
♪ With one last glance ♪

259
00:17:44,890 --> 00:17:47,900
♪ All I want is your smile ♪

260
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:52,400
Song Yiqiu.

261
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:54,590
Did you see that?

262
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:57,750
This is the affection you thought he had,

263
00:17:57,960 --> 00:18:01,350
but it's just a karmic debt he's been
repaying over countless lifetimes.

264
00:18:01,350 --> 00:18:02,680
It's because of this man

265
00:18:02,750 --> 00:18:04,920
that you and Ning Changyue
ended up like this.

266
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,320
-No.
-He deserves to die.

267
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:08,460
Once he is dead, no one will
ruin your relationship again,

268
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:10,860
and my sister's sacrifice
won't be in vain!

269
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:14,310
Your sister?

270
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:17,980
Who exactly are you?

271
00:18:20,080 --> 00:18:23,080
Do you think these
thousands of years of borrowed time

272
00:18:23,510 --> 00:18:25,350
were a blessing from Heaven?

273
00:18:27,550 --> 00:18:29,350
The so-called immortality pill

274
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:32,590
is actually my sister's tree core.

275
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:34,680
Our osmanthus trees

276
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,740
cultivate for a lifetime

277
00:18:36,740 --> 00:18:38,750
to produce only one pair of tree cores.

278
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:39,680
And the tree core

279
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:42,310
can grant eternal life

280
00:18:43,090 --> 00:18:44,600
to true lovers.

281
00:18:46,110 --> 00:18:47,240
But the Tree Spirit,

282
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,550
after losing the tree core,

283
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:52,580
will lose all the spiritual power

284
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:54,440
and return to nature.

285
00:18:58,070 --> 00:18:59,400
Your immortality

286
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:02,310
was bought with my sister's life.

287
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:04,500
She gave you a chance

288
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:05,960
to be together forever.

289
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:07,160
And what about you?

290
00:19:07,830 --> 00:19:10,350
You don't know how to cherish it.

291
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,640
I'm sorry.

292
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:16,480
I don't need your apology.

293
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,590
I just want to kill him!

294
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:19,920
No!

295
00:19:21,280 --> 00:19:21,830
No!

296
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:22,550
Xie He!

297
00:19:51,750 --> 00:19:52,640
He!
